\newlabel{fig:pillar1_scatter}{{6}{12}{\textbf {Pillar~I supplement: two structural priors partially dissociate.} Per-source affirmation-prefix rate (x-axis) vs.\ max-run-$\geq 5$ rate (y-axis) across all Dolci-Instruct-SFT sources. The two priors co-occur but with weak rank correlation ($\rho {=}0.15$), indicating they identify partially distinct surface-mirroring failure modes in the corpus. Sources appearing in the top-12 of Figure~\ref {fig:pillar1_priors} are highlighted.\relax }{figure.caption.27}{}}
